{"title":"The Human City","link":"https://kottke.org/26/03/the-human-city","date":1773939600000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1773853069-3ad4fd89.png\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1773853069-3ad4fd89.png 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1773853069-3ad4fd89.png 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>Photographer and drone pilot <a href=\"https://www.pioandreaperi.it/\">Pio Andrea Peri</a> captured <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=655151936631478&amp;set=pb.100064100312692.-2207520000&amp;type=3\">this overhead photo</a> of a Sicilian city called Centuripe. Perched atop hilltops, the city looks like a person from above — <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/dg8hHsU8ZJanW3c56\">even on Google Maps</a>. (via <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DWB3EDbDibc/\">daily overview</a>)\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/drones\">drones</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/pareidolia\">pareidolia</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Pio%20Andrea%20Peri\">Pio Andrea Peri</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"bc0322d61e1d9f8ce309a6ed1644936e8d0155cd81dd0849489197b41cefb2d7","category":"Sites"}